{"hymn":"S454","parent":"E585","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Me guía Él! ¡Oh qué noción","subtitle":"Experiencia de Cristo—Seguirlo a Él","syl":{"n1":"¡Me","n2":["guí","i"],"n3":["a","t"],"n4":"Él!","n5":"¡Oh","n6":"qué","n7":["no","i"],"n8":["ción!","t"],"n9":"Me","n10":["lle","i"],"n11":["na","t"],"n12":"de","n13":["con","i"],"n15":["so","m"],"n16":["la","m"],"n17":["ción;","t"],"n18":"Lo","n19":"que","n20":"yo","n21":["ha","i"],"n22":["ga‿y","t"],"n23":["don","i"],"n24":["de‿es","m"],"n25":["té,","t"],"n26":"Su","n28":["ma","i"],"n29":["no","t"],"n30":["guí","i"],"n32":["a","t"],"n34":"por","n35":["do","i"],"n36":["quier.","t"],"n37":"¡Me","n38":["guí","i"],"n39":["a","t"],"n40":"Él!","n41":"¡Me","n42":["guí","i"],"n43":["a","t"],"n45":"Él!","n46":"Me","n47":["guí","i"],"n48":["a","t"],"n50":"hoy","n51":"Su","n53":["ma","i"],"n54":["no","t"],"n55":"fiel;","n56":["Si","i"],"n57":["em","m"],"n58":["pre","t"],"n59":["se","i"],"n60":["ré","t"],"n61":"Su","n62":["se","i"],"n63":["gui","m"],"n64":["dor,","t"],"n65":["Por","i"],"n66":["que","t"],"n67":"me","n69":["guí","i"],"n70":["a","t"],"n72":"mi","n73":["Se","i"],"n74":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Si ando yo en confusión,","O si por un Edén en flor,","En calma o en tempestad,","Su mano‿aún me guiará."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Tu mano tomaré, Señor,","Sin murmurar y sin rencor;","Contento‿estoy con mi porción,","Pues Tú me guías en Tu‿amor."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Y cuando‿acabe mi labor","Y por Tu gracia venza yo,","Frente‿a la muerte no huiré;","Triunfante, yo te seguiré."]}]}